SOC Workbooks
SOC workbook, also called playbook, runbook, or workflow, is a structured document that defines the steps required to investigate and remediate specific threats 
efficiently and consistently. Since L1 analysts are considered junior specialists and are not expected to triage every possible attack scenario perfectly, senior 
analysts often prepare workbooks to support their less experienced teammates. L1 analysts are recommended and sometimes even required to triage the alerts precisely
according to workbooks to avoid mistakes and streamline the analysis.

